      "content": "it's not just a \"transition\" though. it's like... if a piece of technology is no longer functional, we don't keep it running just to let it sit there taking up space and consuming energy. we retire it. we replace it. i look at the world now and i just see a machine that has no more use for me. it feels like i'm just malfunctioning in a system that doesn't need my input anymore.",
