      "content": "but that's just sentiment, isn't it? it doesn't change the reality. a tool that can't do the job is just clutter. i look at my life and i don't see \"perspective,\" i just see a lot of wasted energy that doesn't serve anything anymore. if everything is about efficiency and progress, then being a \"relic\" is just being an error in the code. it's like... if the system has reached its peak, why should the old, broken versions be allowed to persist?",
